### Recall API Test Collection (Failure & Edge Cases)
### Target Base URL
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api

###
### 1. Healthcheck
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
Content-Type: application/json

###
### 2. Valid Lesson Request
### Expects: 200 OK with { ok: true, data: { title, summary, sections } }
POST {{baseUrl}}/lesson
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "topic": "Cellular Respiration and ATP Synthesis",
  "level": "intermediate"
}

###
### 3. Failure Case: Empty Topic
### Expects: 400 Bad Request with { ok: false, error: { code: "BAD_INPUT", message: "..." } }
POST {{baseUrl}}/lesson
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "topic": "   ",
  "level": "beginner"
}

###
### 4. Failure Case: Topic Too Short (< 3 characters)
### Expects: 400 Bad Request with { ok: false, error: { code: "BAD_INPUT" } }
POST {{baseUrl}}/lesson
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "topic": "ab",
  "level": "beginner"
}

###
### 5. Failure Case: 9000-Character Topic (Exceeds 8000 max limit)
### Expects: 400 Bad Request with { ok: false, error: { code: "BAD_INPUT" } }
POST {{baseUrl}}/lesson
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "topic": "This topic text is purposefully repetitive and repeats many times to exceed the strict 8000-character upper threshold. ".repeat(75),
  "level": "beginner"
}

###
### 6. Failure Case: Invalid Depth Level
### Expects: 400 Bad Request with { ok: false, error: { code: "BAD_INPUT" } }
POST {{baseUrl}}/lesson
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "topic": "Quantum Computing",
  "level": "ninja_master"
}

###
### 7. Valid Quiz Request
### Expects: 200 OK with { ok: true, data: { questions: [...] } }
POST {{baseUrl}}/quiz
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "lesson": {
    "title": "Photosynthesis",
    "summary": "Process converting sunlight into sugar",
    "sections": [
      {
        "id": "sec-1",
        "heading": "Light-Dependent Reactions",
        "explanation": "Light strikes chlorophyll in the thylakoid membrane."
      },
      {
        "id": "sec-2",
        "heading": "The Calvin Cycle",
        "explanation": "Carbon fixation takes place in the stroma."
      }
    ]
  },
  "count": 4
}

###
### 8. Failure Case: Quiz with Missing Lesson
### Expects: 400 Bad Request with { ok: false, error: { code: "BAD_INPUT" } }
POST {{baseUrl}}/quiz
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "count": 4
}

###
### 9. Valid Remediation Request
### Expects: 200 OK with { ok: true, data: { reteach: [...], mustRemember: [...], memoryTricks: [...], revisionPlan: [...] } }
POST {{baseUrl}}/remediation
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "lesson": {
    "title": "Photosynthesis",
    "sections": [
      {
        "id": "sec-1",
        "heading": "Light Reactions",
        "explanation": "Light energy capture in thylakoids."
      },
      {
        "id": "sec-2",
        "heading": "Calvin Cycle",
        "explanation": "CO2 fixation in stroma."
      }
    ]
  },
  "weakSectionIds": ["sec-1"],
  "wrongQuestions": [
    {
      "question": "Where do light-dependent reactions occur?",
      "selectedOption": "Stroma",
      "correctOption": "Thylakoid membrane"
    }
  ]
}

###
### 10. Failure Case: Remediation with Missing weakSectionIds
### Expects: 400 Bad Request with { ok: false, error: { code: "BAD_INPUT" } }
POST {{baseUrl}}/remediation
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "lesson": {
    "sections": [{ "id": "sec-1" }]
  },
  "weakSectionIds": []
}

